  "question": {
    "text": "<p>If the system of linear equations</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>has infinitely many solutions, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to __________.</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "7",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>For Equation to have infinitely many solutions&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Now,</p><p>Minor of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>6</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Cofactor of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Adjoint of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Therefore,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p>"
